.TH geectl-maintenance-maintained-instances 1  "geectl-maintenance-maintained-instances 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-maintenance\-maintained\-instances \- List the maintained instances of a package: the projects carrying the OBS:Maintained attribute that the package exists in, with where a branch would land. Read\-only; requires OBS credentials
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl maintenance maintained\-instances\fR [\fB\-\-attribute\fR] [\fB\-\-update\-project\-attribute\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-package\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the maintained instances of a package: the projects carrying the OBS:Maintained attribute that the package exists in, with where a branch would land. Read\-only; requires OBS credentials
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
The package whose maintained instances to list
.TP
\fB\-\-attribute\fR \fI<ATTRIBUTE>\fR
The attribute marking a project as maintaining the package (`NAMESPACE:NAME`, default `OBS:Maintained`)
.TP
\fB\-\-update\-project\-attribute\fR \fI<UPDATE_PROJECT_ATTRIBUTE>\fR
The attribute pointing a project at its update project (`NAMESPACE:NAME`, default `OBS:UpdateProject`)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
